# The frontend build uses COPY . ., so use an allowlist. Local .env files,
# certificates, reports, caches and any future unknown file never enter the
# build context or BuildKit cache.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!login.html
!vite.config.js
# 类型门禁：typecheck-gate.test.mjs 会读 tsconfig 与 scripts/，镜像内 npm test 需要它们
# 才能与本地 / PR 门禁保持一致；缺一个就整条流水线在 image 阶段失败。
!tsconfig.typecheck.json
!tsconfig.typecheck-negative.json
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!build/
!build/**
!src/
!src/**
!public/
!public/**
!nginx/
!nginx/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.dump
**/dump*.sql
**/.DS_Store
